{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:15a400926fbf5dbb38b3c07d97afc4c5071814a64070ed22bc4ed43d536c795a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83fd0734272f715fbeb3c2bb602d8cbb18f876bf393082566b131cc621afc16d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー？刚才的播出你看了吗？\n就是前几天的体育综艺。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d28e1daef792a9ba336b3d8be9f0c0c0c014a9c9acdfa48bbb900798fd75380",
      "text": "当然看了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b4168d6725f5aada7340d14aa82fb611f5de5fc75f0ba1e057010435db3aa31",
      "text": "那你应该明白，我这次\n并没有完美通关游戏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e23cd09e830db20f330c88511202b72af65b78df68c658bd8f2ed9207f71655",
      "text": "在正片最后稍微用力过猛了。\n这是心态调节不够到位的后果。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3ee93799cc7ffa778b54de75e1f9d4a90d8bca9462f9aeed86320db44fc2cc0",
      "text": "正式开始前我本以为能完美控制好自己，\n真是太不中用了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4af8151c4f8db19a36b08b3cfc76b087fb3da6d0c366ddf28c72a06b28f53a5",
      "text": "没那回事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b443e7ecf6108f6931132f1f2736afe79a12bfc917de2457275c062e28c1e2b3",
      "text": "表现得很出色哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a141b8253983e0109bcd3e039b3c6003c527420a4dd09d052c995b919c63be7",
      "text": "……算了，我就猜到你会这么说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:440806ca9c3afbcae64512c4a69bf2bea213ce2cf80796957c372c2f4db7f963",
      "text": "……原来如此。把节目效果的成功也算在内的话，\n是这个意思吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c89ab2880c148110c19c274570227342f820574b4abbb90edd4da48ce34828c",
      "text": "但是，既然是游戏，大家所期待的\n应该还是完美通关才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_a:2_4_005_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d401d7483b1e2cc1de8d6df6c3b73bde3ed3e7159a09d9b5f2418335c55edc70",
      "text": "看着吧，制作人。\n下一次工作我一定会拿出完美的成果给你看。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
